; c16-3t-opponent-three. Anchor: shot-0233 (Ch. 16, three trumps).
; Printed: 18 of 81 placements (0.22).
; Claim: with three trumps, one opponent holds three or all four of the
;   missing trumps.
; State: the bidder's seven tiles, nothing played; the 21 others dealt
;   uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 10/57. Book model: 18/81.
(query
  (roles (chair v) (chair x) (domino a) (domino b) (domino c))
  (out)
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (in a q*)
    (in b q*)
    (in c q*)
    (holds x a)
    (holds x b)
    (holds x c)))
